<title>SRI LANKA: Colombo rubber auction postponed to Friday.</title>
<headline>Colombo rubber auction postponed to Friday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weekly Colombo rubber auction scheduled for Thursday has been postponed to Friday because of a public holiday earlier in the week, brokers said.</p>
<p>Tuesday was Sri Lanka's Independence Day.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
